text = "FROST CRYSTAL   difficulty 3/5
from: mined

Nearly frictionless, and always cold. Belts slide out from under it instead of carrying it. It chills whatever it touches.

CHALLENGE: Belts can't move it: push it with tube walls, paddles or gravity. Heat turns it to water, salt melts it, and it's the best coolant."
